meyer had the best starts.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":1,"text":"Hasse, on the other hand, had a bad start as he nearly stalled and immediately lost some 15 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":1,"text":"After one lap Caracciola leads Rosemeyer, then Stuck, von Brauchitsch, Lang, Fagioli, Seaman and von Delius.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":1,"text":"On the very first lap spectator favourite Nuvolari had to make a 1m20s pit stop to change spark plugs.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":26},{"lap":1,"text":"during the first laps of the race the air was so filled with desert sand that the drivers felt like driving in a fog.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":1,"text":"Thirty seconds before the start the light turned to amber and as Marshal Balbo waved the flag the light changed to green. Caracciola and Rosemeyer had the best starts.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":1,"text":"Hasse, on the other hand, had a bad start as he nearly stalled and immediately lost some 15 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":1,"text":"After one lap Caracciola leads Rosemeyer, then Stuck, von Brauchitsch, Lang, Fagioli, Seaman and von Delius.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":1,"text":"On the very first lap spectator favourite Nuvolari had to make a 1m20s pit stop to change spark plugs.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":26},{"lap":1,"text":"during the first laps of the race the air was so filled with desert sand that the drivers felt like driving in a fog.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap Stuck passed Rosemeyer and both were then furiously attacking Caracciola.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap Stuck passed Rosemeyer and both were then furiously attacking Caracciola.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":3,"text":"On the third lap they both passed Caracciola's Mercedes to give Auto Union a double lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":3,"text":"On the third lap they both passed Caracciola's Mercedes to give Auto Union a double lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":4,"text":"After four laps Stuck came in for new tyres after having thrown a tread and he dropped to eighth.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":4,"text":"After four laps Stuck came in for new tyres after having thrown a tread and he dropped to eighth.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":5,"text":"Rosemeyer pits for tyres at the end of lap 5; Fagioli has passed Lang for fourth.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":5,"text":"Rosemeyer pits for tyres at the end of lap 5; Fagioli has passed Lang for fourth.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":6,"text":"Nuvolari retires after more repairs.","q":false,"c":26},{"lap":6,"text":"Nuvolari retires after more repairs.","q":false,"c":26},{"lap":7,"text":"Fagioli passes von Brauchitsch and Caracciola for the lead, then loses a tread and pits; Stuck stops again.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":7,"text":"Caracciola was once again back in the lead. He was followed by Lang, who from close distance had watched the Caracciola-Fagioli duel.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":7,"text":"Fagioli passes von Brauchitsch and Caracciola for the lead, then loses a tread and pits; Stuck stops again.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":7,"text":"Caracciola was once again back in the lead. He was followed by Lang, who from close distance had watched the Caracciola-Fagioli duel.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":8,"text":"Von Brauchitsch re-passes Lang and overhauls Caracciola for the lead, then throws a whole tread in front of the grandstand and pits.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":8,"text":"Von Brauchitsch re-passes Lang and overhauls Caracciola for the lead, then throws a whole tread in front of the grandstand and pits.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":9,"text":"In the voiturette class Dreyfus passes Ghersi for the lead.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":9,"text":"In the voiturette class Dreyfus passes Ghersi for the lead.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":14,"text":"Caracciola pits with tyre trouble; Lang leads.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":14,"text":"Caracciola pits with tyre trouble; Lang leads.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":15,"text":"Lang makes his scheduled stop; Rosemeyer is back in the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"Lang makes his scheduled stop; Rosemeyer is back in the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"At 18 laps Rosemeyer held an 18 second lead over von Brauchitsch with Fagioli another 21seconds behind","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":18,"text":"Von Brauchitsch and Fagioli make their second stops; Lang is second.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"At 18 laps Rosemeyer held an 18 second lead over von Brauchitsch with Fagioli another 21seconds behind","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":18,"text":"Von Brauchitsch and Fagioli make their second stops; Lang is second.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":19,"text":"Rosemeyer nearly lost his Auto Union on the straight when he was hit in the head by a bit of tread from a tire, but he managed to keep the car on the track.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":19,"text":"Rosemeyer makes his half-distance stop and Lang takes the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":19,"text":"Rosemeyer nearly lost his Auto Union on the straight when he was hit in the head by a bit of tread from a tire, but he managed to keep the car on the track.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":19,"text":"Rosemeyer makes his half-distance stop and Lang takes the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":21,"text":"Von Brauchitsch parked his Mercedes after 21 laps after a stone had split the radiator.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":20},{"lap":21,"text":"Von Brauchitsch parked his Mercedes after 21 laps after a stone had split the radiator.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":20},{"lap":23,"text":"Caracciola and Seaman make second stops, 43 and 44 seconds; sand is getting into Caracciola's supercharger.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":23,"text":"Caracciola and Seaman make second stops, 43 and 44 seconds; sand is getting into Caracciola's supercharger.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":24,"text":"Meanwhile up front Lang and Rosemeyer were keeping a high pace, Rosemeyer putting in a 3m31.2s lap and Lang answering with a 3m29.2s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":24,"text":"Meanwhile up front Lang and Rosemeyer were keeping a high pace, Rosemeyer putting in a 3m31.2s lap and Lang answering with a 3m29.2s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":27,"text":"Rosemeyer passes Lang and takes the lead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":27,"text":"Rosemeyer passes Lang and takes the lead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":28,"text":"Trossi retires. Rosemeyer's last stop goes wrong at the fuel rig and takes 1m45s; Lang leads by a good margin.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":28,"text":"Seaman was second in his first race for Mercedes but he was starting to struggle with sand in the supercharger as was Caracciola in third position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":28,"text":"Trossi retires. Rosemeyer's last stop goes wrong at the fuel rig and takes 1m45s; Lang leads by a good margin.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":28,"text":"Seaman was second in his first race for Mercedes but he was starting to struggle with sand in the supercharger as was Caracciola in third position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":30,"text":"Lang makes his second and final stop, 44 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Lang makes his second and final stop, 44 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":35,"text":"Rosemeyer passes Seaman and Caracciola into second, 45 seconds behind Lang; von Delius is third.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":35,"text":"Rosemeyer passes Seaman and Caracciola into second, 45 seconds behind Lang; von Delius is third.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":38,"text":"Caracciola lets Stuck past but blocks Fagioli.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":38,"text":"Caracciola lets Stuck past but blocks Fagioli.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":40,"text":"Lang wins by less than 10 seconds from Rosemeyer; von 